  title: Overskrift
  description: "It's really hot here on the mountain! \nBamboo grows quickly in warm
    weather, so there's plenty of food. That's great! But there's a problem. The
    panda feels too hot and uncomfortable in this weather. \nShould the panda move
    somewhere else or stay on the mountain?  "
  choiceA: Move
  choiceB: Stay
  choiceC: 
  titleDA: Overskrift
  descriptionDA: "Det er virkelig varmt her p\xE5 bjerget! \nBambus vokser hurtigt,
    n\xE5r det er varmt, s\xE5 der er masser af mad. Det er godt! Men der er et problem.
    Pandaen har det alt for varmt og f\xF8ler sig utilpas i det her vejr. \nSkal
    pandaen flytte et andet sted hen eller blive p\xE5 bjerget?  "
  choiceADA: Flyt
  choiceBDA: Bliv
